---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { links } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who Tony O'Halloran is and how he got here.">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Tony O'Halloran</h1>

  <img src="/images/profile.jpeg" alt="Tony O'Halloran" class="profile-img" />

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      At <a href="https://andromede.ai">Andromede</a> I build the RL
      environments and benchmarks that frontier models get graded on. The
      question I keep coming back to: when you give an agent a rule to satisfy,
      when does it play the game, and when does it play the <em>rules</em>?
    </p>
    <p>
      Alongside that I'm a <a href="https://www.pivotal-research.org/">Pivotal
      Research Fellow</a> (LISA, London) working on the technical side of AI
      governance, and AI Advisor at <a href="https://www.thefocuscompany.co/">The Focus Co</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before this: MSc in AI at the University of Galway — thesis with
      the <a href="https://www.light-research.ai/">Yale/EPFL LiGHT Lab</a>.
      Before <em>that</em>: maths at
      UCC and UC Santa Barbara, applied AI in industry, and at sixteen I
      co-founded <a href="https://ty.ie">TY.ie</a>, a platform for Irish
      students that was acquired in 2020.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm from Cork. I live in Girona, Catalonia — which anyone who follows
      road cycling will recognise as a completely rational relocation.
    </p>
    <p class="footnote">
      Formative years: Irish Mathematical Olympiad team, BT Young Scientist,
      SciFest, Young Economist of the Year. I was that kid, and I regret
      nothing.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="contact mono">
    <a href={links.github}>github</a> · <a href={links.linkedin}>linkedin</a> · <a href={links.scholar}>scholar</a>
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .profile-img {
    width: 9rem; border-radius: 10px;
    float: right; margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .footnote { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .contact { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .profile-img { float: none; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; }
  }
</style>
